{"id": "striviaqa0072", "pool": "striviaqa", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 8.64, "n_chunks": 9, "n_concurrent": 9, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.5563, "eot_read_ms": 25, "reference_answer": "jose antonio reyes (accepted aliases: josé antonio reyes calderón, jose antonio reyes, josé antonio reyes)", "query": "Manchester United's Kevin Moran was the first player to he sent off in an FA Cup final, which Arsenal player was the second?", "transcript": "Manchester United's Kevin Moran was the first player to be sent off in an FA Cup final, which Arsenal player was the second?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The baker was making a batch of fresh croissants when he heard a small voice beside him. \"Good morning,\" said the voice. It was the dragon, no bigger than a house cat, with scales that shimmered like polished copper in the sunlight. \"I'm Kevin Moran,\" it said, nodding at the dough. \"I sent off for these ingredients yesterday.\" The baker blinked. \"You're... a dragon?\" \"And you're baking pastries at dawn,\" replied the dragon, already sniffing the air appreciatively. \"It's a tough life, but someone's got to do it.\" The baker chuckled, kneading the dough with renewed vigor. \"Well, I suppose we both have our challenges. So, what brings a small dragon to my bakery this early?\" \"I heard the best croissants are made by hand,\" the dragon said wisely. \"And I wanted to see if that was true.\" As the first golden rays of the sun touched the valley, the scent of butter and yeast filled the air, mingling with the quiet hum of morning life in the village.", "answer_ms": 6658}
